      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since GrVkMemoryAllocator seems to be the only public type that uses these, and the only place in client code that interacts with that is chromium\u0027s custom allocator, I am leaning towards keeping SkEnumBitMask and not bringing GrTFlagsMask into graphite. It seems pretty reasonable to migrate to SkEnumBitMask with a #define and it would also let us rename the class to something more general purpose like `skgpu::VkMemoryAllocator`.",
      "revId": "cb99a1069d28a1727251851e2aa15056768b1bac",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
